1
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:09,200
(INTRO)

2
00:00:09,814 --> 00:00:15,878
I waited for you all month long...

3
00:00:15,878 --> 00:00:22,021
Checking my app, singing a song.

4
00:00:22,021 --> 00:00:26,809
You arrived on the twenty-fifth, bright

5
00:00:26,809 --> 00:00:27,765
and bold

6
00:00:27,765 --> 00:00:34,517
But now my pockets are feeling so cold.

7
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:34,500
(VERSE 1)

8
00:00:34,866 --> 00:00:39,734
We spent one night together, just you

9
00:00:39,734 --> 00:00:42,207
and me

10
00:00:42,207 --> 00:00:47,314
Then came the bills, and the rental fee.

11
00:00:47,314 --> 00:00:52,738
I bought a coffee, filled up the tank

12
00:00:52,738 --> 00:00:58,372
Now looking at zeros inside of the bank.

13
00:00:58,300 --> 00:00:58,400
(CHORUS)

14
00:00:58,722 --> 00:01:04,867
Oh, why do you leave me? Why do you fly?

15
00:01:04,867 --> 00:01:10,531
My sweet monthly salary, saying goodbye.

16
00:01:10,531 --> 00:01:15,878
You were here for a moment, a flash of

17
00:01:15,878 --> 00:01:16,915
light

18
00:01:16,915 --> 00:01:22,739
Now I'm eating noodles alone in the

19
00:01:22,739 --> 00:01:24,144
night.

20
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:24,100
(BRIDGE)

21
00:01:24,495 --> 00:01:30,159
Come back to me... please don't go.

22
00:01:30,159 --> 00:01:33,750
I have three weeks left, and the funds

23
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:35,823
are low.

24
00:01:35,823 --> 00:01:39,894
Credit card calling, asking for more

25
00:01:39,894 --> 00:01:53,745
I'm just a rich man who's suddenly poor.

26
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:53,700
(OUTRO)

27
00:01:54,096 --> 00:02:00,927
See you next month... maybe.

28
00:02:00,927 --> 00:02:06,064
Goodbye.
